{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司人工智能業務可能再次迎來重大人事調整。負責領導Siri AI開發的蘋果高管邁克·洛克威爾（Mike Rockwell）正在認真考慮自己的職業去向，可能在2027年卸任Siri AI負責人，甚至不排除徹底離開蘋果。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585510.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.571085+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T15:34:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"248fc039b0f44827e27894a03356f37a821feb5aa50b4d39627663101246affe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}